## MCP - Documents Estimate (RFC-014)

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/documents/estimate

**Input:**
- `file_url` or `file_base64`: Document
- `file_type`: pdf | png | jpg | etc.
- `action`: translate | summarize
- `plugin_context.pricing`: Pricing config
- `plugin_context.ocr_thresholds`: { min_confidence, hebrew_min_confidence, aramaic_min_confidence }

**Output:**
- `estimation`: { tokens, pages, ocr_required, detected_language }
- `credits`: { estimated, breakdown, max_possible }
- `ocr_thresholds`: { applied, config }
- `warnings`: array
